{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goblin Dungeons</strong> is a roguelike RPG with adult elements. Fight dangerous foes, master powerful magic, and experience sensual encounters in a dark fantasy world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/1.gif?t=1746018437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Erotis has fallen to the goblins. Most life is wiped out, and the survivors are enslaved. Only the ancient elven priestesses still had hope \u2014 performing a secret ritual to summon help from another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/3.gif?t=1746018437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Ellie, a girl who died in our world and was revived by a forgotten god. To return home, you must destroy the Goblin Lord. Gifted with magic and immortality, you rise again after every death \u2014 stronger than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/2.gif?t=1746018437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Fast-paced combat with unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Deep magic system with 5 schools to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 Upgrade your base, unlock skills and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 Random events and seductive encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd1e Erotic content with interactive scenes, X-Ray mode, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you fulfill the contract and save Erotis \u2014 or will you remain trapped in an endless cycle of death and rebirth?</p>","background":"https: